"Check the wallet's current HOOD exposure and whether the author changes the stated support and target levels." = "检查该钱包当前的 HOOD 敞口，并关注作者是否调整支撑位和目标价。";

"A bullish NVDA view met a small onchain long exit" = "NVDA 看多观点与一笔小额链上多头平仓同时出现";
"A high-ranked author stayed bullish while a Smart-tier public account later closed about $99 of NVDA long exposure." = "一位高排名作者继续看多，但一个 Smart 级公开账户随后平掉了约 99 美元的 NVDA 多头敞口。";
"The directions differ, but the observed wallet exit is too small to outweigh the creator evidence. Treat it as a weak divergence, not a bearish signal." = "两类证据方向不同，但该钱包的平仓规模过小，不足以抵消作者观点。应视为弱背离，而非看空信号。";
"Watch for larger NVDA position changes across multiple Smart-tier wallets before changing concentration." = "在调整持仓集中度前，先观察多个 Smart 级钱包是否出现更大规模的 NVDA 仓位变化。";

"A high-ranked MSTR author tightened the thesis risk limit" = "高排名 MSTR 作者收紧了观点的风险边界";
"The author remains constructive over twelve months but moved the invalidation level closer to the current price." = "该作者仍看好未来十二个月，但将失效价位调整得更接近当前价格。";
"The long-term thesis remains positive, while the tighter risk limit shows less tolerance for a drawdown. No qualifying public capital evidence is available for confirmation." = "长期观点仍然积极，但更紧的风险边界表明其对回撤的容忍度下降。目前没有符合条件的公开资金证据可以确认该观点。";
"Compare the revised $350 invalidation level with your cost basis and holding horizon before changing the position." = "调整仓位前，将更新后的 350 美元失效价位与你的持仓成本和持有周期进行比较。";

"A qualified public account opened a small PLTR position" = "一个有效公开账户建立了小额 PLTR 仓位";
"A qualified Hyperliquid account opened about $196 of PLTR long exposure while no independent Smart Account update met the window." = "一个符合条件的 Hyperliquid 账户建立了约 196 美元的 PLTR 多头敞口，但当前窗口内没有独立的 Smart Account 观点更新。";
"The action is real but small and comes from a Qualified-tier rather than Smart-tier wallet. It is context for monitoring, not a strong capital signal." = "该操作真实但规模较小，且来自 Qualified 级而非 Smart 级钱包。它可作为监测背景，但不构成强资金信号。";
"Watch the public account for follow-through and compare any subsequent creator thesis with the account's entry window." = "关注该公开账户是否继续行动，并将后续作者观点与该账户的入场窗口进行比较。";

"A new AVGO thesis has no qualifying capital confirmation yet" = "新的 AVGO 观点尚无符合条件的资金确认";
"A top-ranked semiconductor author initiated an AVGO thesis, while no current Smart-tier onchain action meets the confirmation window." = "一位头部半导体作者提出了 AVGO 投资观点，但当前没有 Smart 级链上操作进入确认窗口。";
"The qualified creator thesis is relevant for research, but the current onchain dataset does not provide independent Smart-tier confirmation." = "该有效作者观点值得研究，但当前链上数据尚不能提供独立的 Smart 级资金确认。";
